				</outline>
			</outline>
			<outline text="examples/stringAddressToString.md">
				<outline text="# string.addressToString">
					<outline text="I noticed that the names of objects in the Window menu were much longer than they needed to be. I asked if we had a way to shorten them, and we did not. Then I looked in the pre-Atlantis Frontier, and it had the same problem, which told me I've been using it this way for hundreds of years or so it seems. So together we figure out where this fit -- there was even a string.stringToAddress verb. ">
					</outline>
					<outline text="9/14/26; 10:51:38 AM by DW">
					</outline>
				</outline>
				<outline text="&lt;%exampleUsertalkCode (@system.verbs.builtins.string.addressToString)%>">
				</outline>
			</outline>
			<outline text="examples/timing.md">
				<outline text="# workspace.timing">
					<outline text="The last time we ran this script was in August, now it takes approx twice the time for each call.">
					</outline>
					<outline text="9/14/26; 11:15:57 AM by DW">
					</outline>
				</outline>
				<outline text="&lt;%exampleUsertalkCode (@workspace.doVeryLittle)%>">
