				</outline>
			</outline>
			<outline text="examples/twitterNewPost.md">
				<outline text="# twitter.newPost">
					<outline text="Was having a conversation with friends about the capability of glue scripts. This is an example of a script that was started in 2007, about a year after Twitter started up. No doubt this API is no longer supported, but it gives you an idea what's possible using HTTP. It was being maintained through April, 2011. ">
					</outline>
				</outline>
				<outline text="&lt;%exampleUsertalkCode (@twitter.newpost)%>">
				</outline>
			</outline>
		</outline>
		<outline text="build script">
			<outline text="nodeEditorSuite.utilities.buildHelloFrontier ()">
			</outline>
